cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the real word set, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Handwritten Meitei Mayek word recognition: code, synthesiser, results and demonstration"
abstract: >-
  The first segmentation-free recogniser of handwritten Meitei Mayek words, trained on
  synthetic words composed from the isolated characters of TUMMHCD. The repository holds the
  word synthesiser, the recogniser and its training and evaluation code, the results files,
  the browser demonstration, and a set of 100 real handwritten words (released under CC BY 4.0
  in real_words/).
authors:
